            "content_descriptors": {
                "ids": [
                    1,
                    2,
                    5
                ],
                "notes": "Red Haze stars Rockette, a drug-addicted woman who is going off to meet her drug dealer as a core central plot point to the game. Drugs are mentioned quite often, both legal and illegal ones. The game contains violence, gore, and body horror. There's strong themes of prostitution and human trafficking. There's veiled nudity; the main character walks around naked in some scenes but they lack genital/nipples during such scenes. There's strong themes of depression, suicide, and struggling with mental health problems and loneliness. There is disturbing monster designs, and background characters we read about through notes with malicious intent to others. Red Haze is only really appropriate for audiences over the age of 18."
            },
